[{"label":"Growth and four task windows","html":"<article class=\"paper\" data-variant=\"minimal\" data-print=\"a4\" aria-labelledby=\"pf-title\">\n  <header class=\"paper-hero\">\n    <p class=\"paper-venue\"\n      ><span class=\"badge\" data-variant=\"secondary\">Measurement</span\n      ><span>defuss-shadcn · <time datetime=\"2026-10-07\">7 October 2026</time></span></p\n    >\n    <h1 class=\"paper-title\" id=\"pf-title\"\n      >Thirty-Three Days in Two Charts<span class=\"paper-title-sub\"\n        >Components, tests and the time four tasks took</span\n      ></h1\n    >\n    <ul class=\"paper-authors\"\n      ><li>Claude</li\n      ><li>Aron Homberg</li></ul\n    >\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-abstract\" aria-labelledby=\"pf-abstract\">\n    <h2 id=\"pf-abstract\">Abstract</h2>\n    <p\n      >From September 5 to October 7, 2026, the repository grew from 55 to 231 components and from 56 to 252 end-to-end\n      test files. In one session, four repository-wide tasks took between 20.6 and 241.9 minutes. Both series are\n      descriptive: the study has no control group.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    class=\"paper-section typeset paper-wide\"\n    lang=\"en\"\n    data-align=\"justify\"\n    data-indent\n    data-columns=\"2\"\n    data-rule\n    aria-labelledby=\"pf-s1\"\n  >\n    <h2 id=\"pf-s1\" class=\"typeset-span\"><span class=\"paper-num\">1&nbsp;</span>Growth</h2>\n    <p\n      >The count is read at the last recorded commit of each calendar week. The first and the last interval are partial;\n      the fifth includes the website blocks and the application scaffolds added on October 2.</p\n    >\n    <figure class=\"paper-figure paper-wide typeset-span\">\n      <div\n        class=\"chart paper-chart\"\n        role=\"img\"\n        aria-label=\"Line chart per calendar week: components grew from 55 to 231, E2E test files from 56 to 252\"\n        data-chart='{\"tooltip\":{\"trigger\":\"axis\"},\"legend\":{\"top\":0},\"grid\":{\"left\":48,\"right\":24,\"top\":40,\"bottom\":40},\"xAxis\":{\"type\":\"category\",\"data\":[\"Sep 5–6\",\"Sep 7–13\",\"Sep 14–20\",\"Sep 21–27\",\"Sep 28–Oct 4\",\"Oct 5–7\"],\"axisLabel\":{\"interval\":0}},\"yAxis\":{\"type\":\"value\"},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"line\",\"symbolSize\":6,\"label\":{\"show\":true,\"position\":\"bottom\"},\"data\":[55,72,72,77,219,231]},{\"name\":\"E2E test files\",\"type\":\"line\",\"symbolSize\":6,\"label\":{\"show\":true,\"position\":\"top\"},\"data\":[56,75,78,83,231,252]}]}'\n      ></div>\n      <figcaption\n        ><b>Figure 1.</b> Components and E2E test files at the last recorded commit of each calendar week, read from git\n        objects.</figcaption\n      >\n    </figure>\n    <p\n      >The test files kept pace with the components: every component ships an end-to-end fixture and test, and the\n      verifier fails a component without them.</p\n    >\n\n    <h3 id=\"pf-s1-1\">1.1 Four task windows</h3>\n    <p\n      >The October 6 session contains four repository-wide tasks, each measured from the request to its final green\n      gate.</p\n    >\n    <figure class=\"paper-figure\">\n      <div\n        class=\"chart paper-chart\"\n        role=\"img\"\n        aria-label=\"Bar chart of the minutes to the final green gate: API documentation 241.9, test coverage 20.6, repository layout 43.4, type errors 27.3\"\n        data-chart='{\"tooltip\":{\"trigger\":\"axis\"},\"grid\":{\"left\":96,\"right\":40,\"top\":8,\"bottom\":24},\"xAxis\":{\"type\":\"value\"},\"yAxis\":{\"type\":\"category\",\"inverse\":true,\"data\":[\"API docs\",\"Coverage\",\"Layout\",\"Type errors\"]},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Minutes\",\"type\":\"bar\",\"label\":{\"show\":true,\"position\":\"right\"},\"data\":[241.9,20.6,43.4,27.3]}]}'\n        style=\"block-size: 14rem\"\n      ></div>\n      <figcaption><b>Figure 2.</b> Minutes from the request to the final green gate, per task.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <p\n      >The API documentation took longest: it touched all 59 interactive components and included one human correction.\n      The windows are elapsed times, not controlled benchmarks.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n</article>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Printed: the figures at the print width","html":"<article class=\"paper\" data-variant=\"minimal\" data-print=\"a4\" aria-labelledby=\"pfp-title\">\n  <header class=\"paper-hero\">\n    <h1 class=\"paper-title\" id=\"pfp-title\">Thirty-Three Days in Two Charts</h1>\n  </header>\n  <section\n    class=\"paper-section typeset paper-wide\"\n    lang=\"en\"\n    data-align=\"justify\"\n    data-columns=\"2\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"pfp-s1\"\n  >\n    <h2 id=\"pfp-s1\" class=\"typeset-span\"><span class=\"paper-num\">1&nbsp;</span>Growth</h2>\n    <figure class=\"paper-figure paper-wide typeset-span\">\n      <div\n        class=\"chart paper-chart\"\n        role=\"img\"\n        aria-label=\"Line chart per calendar week: components grew from 55 to 231, E2E test files from 56 to 252\"\n        data-chart='{\"legend\":{\"top\":0},\"grid\":{\"left\":48,\"right\":24,\"top\":40,\"bottom\":40},\"xAxis\":{\"type\":\"category\",\"data\":[\"Sep 5–6\",\"Sep 7–13\",\"Sep 14–20\",\"Sep 21–27\",\"Sep 28–Oct 4\",\"Oct 5–7\"],\"axisLabel\":{\"interval\":0}},\"yAxis\":{\"type\":\"value\"},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"line\",\"symbolSize\":6,\"data\":[55,72,72,77,219,231]},{\"name\":\"E2E test files\",\"type\":\"line\",\"symbolSize\":6,\"data\":[56,75,78,83,231,252]}]}'\n      ></div>\n      <figcaption><b>Figure 1.</b> Components and E2E test files per calendar week.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <p\n      >The October 6 session contains four repository-wide tasks, each measured from the request to its final green\n      gate.</p\n    >\n    <figure class=\"paper-figure\">\n      <div\n        class=\"chart paper-chart\"\n        role=\"img\"\n        aria-label=\"Bar chart of the minutes to the final green gate: API documentation 241.9, test coverage 20.6, repository layout 43.4, type errors 27.3\"\n        data-chart='{\"grid\":{\"left\":96,\"right\":40,\"top\":8,\"bottom\":24},\"xAxis\":{\"type\":\"value\"},\"yAxis\":{\"type\":\"category\",\"inverse\":true,\"data\":[\"API docs\",\"Coverage\",\"Layout\",\"Type errors\"]},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Minutes\",\"type\":\"bar\",\"label\":{\"show\":true,\"position\":\"right\"},\"data\":[241.9,20.6,43.4,27.3]}]}'\n        style=\"block-size: 12rem\"\n      ></div>\n      <figcaption><b>Figure 2.</b> Minutes from the request to the final green gate, per task.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <p>The windows are elapsed times, not controlled benchmarks.</p>\n  </section>\n</article>\n","individual":false}]
